    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya yayilwa mwikulu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho olwa OMWAMI yali nali okhumukulusilia Eliya mushiimbalakusi okhumuyila mwikulu, Eliya yarula eGiligali, halala nende Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya namusunjila Elisha ari Chama olinde hano; okhuba OMWAMI urumile ehale, okhuula eBeteli. Elisha nakalusia mbu Shinga OMWAMI olwa ali mwoyo, khandi shinga iwe omwene olwa oli mwoyo, shikhulekha ta. Kho nibakholomokha niboola eBeteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abaana babanabii abali nibali eBeteli barula nibeetsela Elisha, nibamureeba mbu Omanyile mbu leelo OMWAMI alabukula omwamiwo oukhurukanga, akhurulekhwo? Naye ari Ee, emanyile; muholeele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Eliya namusunjila mbu Elisha, chama olinde hano; okhuba OMWAMI urumile eYeriko. Naye nakalusia mbu Shinga OMWAMI olwa ali mwoyo, khandi shinga iwe omwene olwa oli mwoyo, shikhulekha ta. Kho niboola eYeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abaana babanabii abali nibali eYeriko nibasita ahambi khuElisha, nibamureeba mbu Omanyile mbu leelo OMWAMI alabukula omwamiwo oukhurukanga, akhurulekhwo? Naye ari Ee, emanyile; muholeele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Eliya namusunjila mbu Chama olinde hano; okhuba OMWAMI urumile eYorodani. Naye nakalusia mbu Shinga OMWAMI olwa ali mwoyo, khandi shinga iwe omwene olwa oli mwoyo, shikhulekha ta. Kho nibatsiililila bombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abandu amakhumi karaano abokhubaana babanabii nibatsia nibasinjila ahahengaane ninabo, ehalene abo babili nibasinjila haYorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Eliya nabukula inguboye ifuubila, nachifumba, nakhupa amatsi, nako nikakabukhana eyi nende eyi; mana bombi babili nibachenda khwiloba eliumu, nibaambukha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa bali nibaambuushe, Eliya yasunjila Elisha ari Usabe eshia ekhukholela, nishili okhubukulwa ekhurulekhwo. Naye Elisha nasunga mbu Ekhusaaya mbu omukabo kwarohoyo kungwile shikhabili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nasunga mbu Osabile likhuwa litinyu; habula noba niundola nimbukulwa nikhurulakhwo, olakholelwa orio; nebutswa norandola ta, shiolakholelwa orio tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa bali nibashitsiililila nibasungananga, lola, likaari liomulilo ndilo, netsifarasi tsiomulilo, nitsibakabukhasia naye Eliya nakulushila mushiimbalakusi nayilwa mwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Elisha nalola, nalanga mbu Papa, papa, amakaari kaIsiraeli, nabachendela khufarasi! Naramulolakhwo khandi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha yakalukha mushilenje shiaEliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana natiila khungubo tsitsie omwene, natsirandula ebitonye bibili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabukula nende ingubo ifuubila yaEliya eyali niyilakaashe niyimurulakhwo, nakalukha, nasinjila khulukuku lwaYorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabukula ingubo tsana yaEliya eyali niyilakaashe niyimurulakhwo, nakhupa amatsi, nalanga mbu Ali heena OMWAMI, Nyasaye waEliya? Ne olwa yali nakhupile amatsi, kakabukhana eyi nende eyi. Mana Elisha niyaambukha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa abaana babanabii tsana bamulola, abali nibali eYeriko nibahengaane ninaye, baboola mbu Roho yaEliya yiyeerile khuElisha. Nibeetsa okhumwakaanila, nibeenama hasi imbeliwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamusunjila mbu Lola, ifwe abasumbabo khuli nende abandu amakhumi karaano abamaani; chama batsie, bakhaabe omwamiwo; haundi Roho wOMWAMI yakhaba namuchinjile namusukuna khushikulu shindi, kata mwibanda. Naye nakaana mbu Murabaruma ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa olwa bamunichilisia okhuula olwa yalola eshifwimbwa omurwe, namala nasunga mbu Mubarume. Kho nibaruma abandu amakhumi karaano; nabo nibakhaaba tsindaalo tsitaru, nibaramunyoola ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamukalushila olwa yali nashilindanga eYeriko; nabasunjila mbu Shimukaaniye mbu Muratsia ta?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abandu belitookho elo nibasunjila Elisha bari Ohenje habundu welitookho lino, mbu nahakaasu, shinga omwami wanje olwa olola; habula amatsi namabii, khandi liloba lifubinjia ebiamo bialio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nasunga mbu Mundeerele eshikaye eshiyia, nimurakhwo omuunyu. Nibamuleerela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye narula, natsia hasebele yamatsi, nafuubamwo omuunyu, nasunga mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu Ehoniye amatsi kano; okhufwa kata okhufubia shikhularulakhwomwo khandi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho amatsi ako nikakwa amalayi okhuula olwa leelo, likhuwa elia Elisha yaboola shinga olwa liali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana natikulukha narulayo natsia eBeteli; ne olwa yali nali khunjila natsiitsanga, abasiani bandi barula mwitaala nibamutseshelela, bari Tikulukha, iwe oweshiole! Tikulukha, iwe oweshiole! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nakhupa amashemo inyuma nabalola, nabalaka eshilaka munwa muliira liOMWAMI. Mana tsitubu tsikhasi tsibili nitsirula mumutsuru nitsikwarula-kwarula amakhumi kane nababili khubayia abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
